# ─── Rust / Cargo ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored: it is tracked, the contract is a
# deployable artifact, and CI builds with --locked. It used to be listed here
# while also being committed, which meant tooling (Dependabot's soroban-sdk bump)
# silently dropped its lockfile update and the committed lockfile drifted a whole
# major version behind Cargo.toml.
target/

